#A plate is valid only if all requirements pass (even if one requirement fails = invalid)
#We can translate the verification/check into 4 tests/stages:
#Length between 2 and 6 characters (letters and numbers)?
#First two characters letters?
#Only letters and numbers?
#If numbers appear: is the first number not 0 and are all remaining characters before letters?

